**Three parallel fact-type converters mapping `FactType` variants: two enums and one stringly-typed inline match**

- **ID:** `cli/design-stringly-typed-fact-type-triple`
- **Severity:** high
- **Area:** cli · **Type:** refactor
- **Location:** `memory-engine-cli/src/commands/add_fact.rs:12-27, memory-engine-cli/src/commands/batch_ingest.rs:63-78, memory-engine-cli/src/commands/query.rs:89-98`
- **Auto-fixable:** no

## Description
Current state: `FactTypeArg` (add_fact.rs:12-27) and `JsonlFactType` (batch_ingest.rs:63-78) are separate enums with identical structure and identical `From<_> for FactType` implementations. A third site (query.rs:89-98) uses an inline `match ft.to_lowercase().as_str()` with an `anyhow::bail!` fallback — a fully stringly-typed approach that re-implements the same three-way mapping without compile-time safety. `memory_engine::FactType` has no `FromStr` or `ValueEnum` impl (confirmed by grep of src/types.rs), so CLI-local wrappers are necessary — but three of them for the same three variants is avoidable duplication. Target state: one shared `#[derive(ValueEnum, Deserialize)] enum CliFactType` in `commands/mod.rs` (or a new `commands/types.rs`), with both a `From<CliFactType> for FactType` impl and `#[serde(rename_all = "snake_case")]` to satisfy both the clap and serde consumers. `query.rs` drops the stringly-typed inline match and uses `CliFactType::from_str` via clap. Refactoring pattern: Extract Superclass / Consolidate Duplicate Conditional Fragments. Motivation: DRY, single point of change when adding a new `FactType` variant, removes the last stringly-typed fact-type path. Scope: 3 files (add_fact.rs, batch_ingest.rs, query.rs) + 1 new/modified shared file. Prerequisites: none beyond the refactor. Risk: low — mechanical variant renaming; serde `rename_all` must match existing JSONL fixture format.

## Suggested approach
// In commands/types.rs (new file):
#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, clap::ValueEnum, serde::Deserialize)]
#[serde(rename_all = "snake_case")]
pub(crate) enum CliFactType { Episodic, Semantic, Procedural }

impl From<CliFactType> for memory_engine::FactType {
    fn from(t: CliFactType) -> Self {
        match t {
            CliFactType::Episodic => Self::Episodic,
            CliFactType::Semantic => Self::Semantic,
            CliFactType::Procedural => Self::Procedural,
        }
    }
}
// Delete FactTypeArg, JsonlFactType; replace query.rs inline match with clap ValueEnum parse.

