**`EmbeddingProvider::embed` impl has no /// doc comment**

- **ID:** `embed/documentation-embed-no-doc`
- **Severity:** high
- **Area:** core · **Type:** docs
- **Location:** `/home/mroynard/dev/memory-engine/memory-engine-embed/src/http.rs:116`
- **Auto-fixable:** no

## Description
The `embed` method on the `EmbeddingProvider` impl block (http.rs:116-181) carries zero documentation. The method has four distinct error conditions: (1) HTTP send failure → `MemoryError::Internal`; (2) non-2xx HTTP status → `MemoryError::Internal` with status+body; (3) JSON parse failure → `MemoryError::Internal`; (4) unknown response format → `MemoryError::Internal`; (5) dimension mismatch → `MemoryError::EmbeddingDimension`; (6) NaN/Inf in result → `MemoryError::Internal`. None of these are documented. Users relying only on generated docs have no way to know which errors to expect or match on.

